<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Cleo – Support</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f7f7f8;
            color: #1d1d1f;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e7;
            padding: 20px 24px;
        }

        .nav {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #8b5cf6;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 24px 70px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f3ff, #ffffff);
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 58px);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 620px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-size: 19px;
            color: #6e6e73;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 30px 24px 80px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 36px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            border: 1px solid #e8e8ed;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        p {
            color: #515154;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .support-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            background: #1d1d1f;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        .support-button:hover {
            opacity: 0.85;
        }

        .features {
            list-style: none;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .features li {
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;
            color: #515154;
        }

        .features li:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 35px 20px;
            color: #86868b;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        footer a {
            color: #515154;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .card {
                padding: 26px;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 60px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <div class="nav">
            <div class="logo">CLE<span>O</span></div>
            <div>Support</div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>How can we help?</h1>
        <p>
            Welcome to Cleo Support. We're here to help you get the most out
            of your outfit planning experience.
        </p>
    </section>

    <main>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>About Cleo</h2>

            <p>
                Cleo is an outfit planner designed to help you discover outfit
                ideas based on your personal preferences.
            </p>

            <ul class="features">
                <li>Choose your preferred style</li>
                <li>Select an occasion and season</li>
                <li>Set your budget</li>
                <li>Discover complete outfit ideas</li>
                <li>Explore recommended stores</li>
                <li>Save outfits you like</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Need Help?</h2>

            <p>
                If you have questions, experience a problem, or need assistance
                with Cleo, please contact us and we'll do our best to help.
            </p>

            <a href="mailto:nirvankotest@gmail.com" class="support-button">
                Contact Support
            </a>
        </section>

        <section class="card">
            <h2>Subscription Support</h2>

            <p>
                Cleo Premium gives you access to unlimited outfit generations.
                If you experience any issues with your subscription or purchase,
                please contact support.
            </p>

            <a href="mailto:nirvankotest@gmail.com" class="support-button">
                Get Subscription Help
            </a>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 Cleo. All rights reserved.</p>
        <a href="mailto:nirvankotest@gmail.com">
            nirvankotest@gmail.com
        </a>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
